I come out of the sports hall.
The evening air is pleasantly cool.
My legs are very tired.
But I am very cheerful.
I get on my bicycle.
Then I set off.
The ride through the city is beautiful.
I like riding through Berlin in the evening.
I think about the club.
I can play badminton every Thursday now.
And I already know three nice people there.
Timo, Lena and Max are very friendly.
We want to play together again next week.
The streets are dark and quiet now.
Soon I am at my flat.
I just want to take a shower now.
It was a great evening.
